{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>有「鬼王」之稱的資深藝人雷宇揚，本月7日因胃癌病逝，終年62歲。據網媒《娛壹》報道指其妻子已對外證實死訊。據悉，雷宇揚早年曾罹患癌症，至年前不幸舊病復發，最終不敵病魔離世。雷宇揚2012年與內地女主播馬荔婚後長居廣州，婚後雷宇揚淡出幕前，反觀老婆熱衷抖音，馬荔留着一頭烏黑長髮，皮膚白滑緊緻，身材更是十分出眾，纖腰、長腿、豐滿上圍樣樣齊。</p><figure><img alt=\"雷宇揚細21歲老婆好Fit ！（截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260911/1175100786158604288267853.png/YjiuE3Q0v55dAaST2shyXDqOVEEgDo455mCAh-ZggIc\"/><figcaption>雷宇揚細21歲老婆好Fit ！（截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"雷宇揚細21歲老婆好Fit ！（截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260911/1175100783180517376031472.png/kt6j3cD6kWyOxQQ070Q7PQV6Jn4fQrNlduA-pHbgPqQ\"/><figcaption>雷宇揚細21歲老婆好Fit ！（截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"雷宇揚細21歲老婆好Fit ！（截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260911/1175100780399562752274193.png/jW3KiACVmTm1JZu4g6ucUTeLILn2S6z-Y9mHemPZh3o\"/><figcaption>雷宇揚細21歲老婆好Fit ！（截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"獨幢別墅。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230302/708046282706391040926581.png/lIS0yfhzR1wFV7BR2M11KJPdIyeMz9eM_5Whvf-Vob0\"/><figcaption>獨幢別墅。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"有泳池\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230302/708046285122441216780492.png/FtjoPkudo2pVk0dk5mImnryxDps2hbHC_zd15f83deU\"/><figcaption>有泳池</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"室外都好大地方\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230302/708046287421050880701825.png/mZ8BJeRz4N-jGUDoRT4XVzRgq5vvu8KnkJzi0ZCc4tE\"/><figcaption>室外都好大地方</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"係拍抖音嘅好地方\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230302/708046290004873216756984.png/qUiaGmneksWkBTOi2jxSJuJs6lXdXkXf4-Mbb-PjG28\"/><figcaption>係拍抖音嘅好地方</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"天台\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230302/708046292903268352180426.png/jna7pAVeRUJKufSh5gkcEJ6FEB_inykyZAFfH2QBXx8\"/><figcaption>天台</figcaption></figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230302/708044519966248960170534.png/Z29VUYf5OyIa7__EwlRGUd1K3ScnB0xvMaRwwjGkcMI\"/><figure><img alt=\"開放式廚房\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230302/708046295373975552916480.png/txNmkjcUnMeuK0LZhOtgmA7M2mja7OO0wfq9AMH6vQA\"/><figcaption>開放式廚房</figcaption></figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230302/708044665554735104023486.png/M_7bLcPBxhmQvb_8xkd6YhmzGTbuRO3Z04xGTNOMRkw\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230302/708046297681104896107864.png/YfRvDCYpw8D1UIQQN9xuyIFq1bhyb1f4mKXCVpilwlY\"/><p>對於自己的好身材，馬荔亦從不吝惜，每次出鏡的衣著打扮都落足心機：短裙、吊帶背心、黑絲和Hermès手袋應有盡有。抖音帳戶中，唔少短片都係喺家中拍攝，獨幢別墅樓高約三層，屋外嘅空地除設有泳池及休閒設備之外，亦停有兩、三架私家車，足見其空間感。不過，喺眾多影片中，老公雷宇揚、兒子雷庭從未出鏡。</p><figure><img alt=\"孭Hermès手袋好富貴！（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260911/1175100421413539840832491.png/VLP9l2Rux6XGJT04CGi6bc6GBbDBvYXuFkUJRxZFCUc\"/><figcaption>孭Hermès手袋好富貴！（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"孭Hermès手袋好富貴！（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260911/1175100418376732672879316.png/OjFCI4WRZSvxZB8nZssiikd21xgUcQ-9M_168TP9evE\"/><figcaption>孭Hermès手袋好富貴！（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"孭Hermès手袋好富貴！（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260911/1175100415436394496697230.png/8Hh-ROsnxi9BpJdiO6L47LDy2ba8A20BQZgdJUGYHSU\"/><figcaption>孭Hermès手袋好富貴！（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"雷宇揚移居內地後十分低調。（微博圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20200924/385853696501747712.jpeg/Ceo8JZe-CNyUOB_Vziy2g8CuelDE_c5xT2fwhU9n8IU\"/><figcaption>雷宇揚移居內地後十分低調。（微博圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-11T07:40:43.151886+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":491,"images":16,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}